        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088400/extras/087c090da3663913019010aebf4b93f5.avif?t=1762025090\" width=1047 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088400/extras/5da0e48440ccd3e234eb70085ebb7359.avif?t=1762025090\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Description:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this visual novel, the protagonist is a programmer named Alexey, whose life is drowning in the gray routine of loneliness. Tired of the endless monotony, he imagines an ideal girl, Lily, and immerses himself with her in the illusory world of a sanatorium. But over time, these fantasies expand beyond mere dreams, blurring the boundaries between reality and illusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about internal conflict and the search for harmony with oneself!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare Tulpa game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main characters in the story: Alex, Lily</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, captivating story (approximately 2 hours to complete).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style of old novels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scriptwriter: Kket.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: heartwarming sprites by ppipiduster, mesmerizing dove art by luos_arts, CG art by Black on White and deathwarr.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian voice actors by Anijoy: Alexey is Evgeny Valdanov (ShadowWarrior), and Lily is Elizaveta Dobrovolskaya (jujlu).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composers: atmospheric music by That Guy From 2015 and mc.dummy. </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088400/extras/087c090da3663913019010aebf4b93f5.avif?t=1762025090\" width=1047 height=96 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4088400/extras/5da0e48440ccd3e234eb70085ebb7359.avif?t=1762025090\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Description:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this visual novel, the protagonist is a programmer named Alexey, whose life is drowning in the gray routine of loneliness. Tired of the endless monotony, he imagines an ideal girl, Lily, and immerses himself with her in the illusory world of a sanatorium. But over time, these fantasies expand beyond mere dreams, blurring the boundaries between reality and illusion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story about internal conflict and the search for harmony with oneself!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rare Tulpa game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two main characters in the story: Alex, Lily</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kinetic story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, captivating story (approximately 2 hours to complete).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual style of old novels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scriptwriter: Kket.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artists: heartwarming sprites by ppipiduster, mesmerizing dove art by luos_arts, CG art by Black on White and deathwarr.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Russian voice actors by Anijoy: Alexey is Evgeny Valdanov (ShadowWarrior), and Lily is Elizaveta Dobrovolskaya (jujlu).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composers: atmospheric music by That Guy From 2015 and mc.dummy. </p></li></ul>",
